Z||000012||mwbackus||10-28-1999||12:08 AM||||I believe the flowmaster part above is about 2" longer than the stock Fiero muffler.  Therefore, the exhaust will have to be modified somewhat for it to fit.  Not really much of a problem, but I did note it for the record. :-)||||reg||1
